---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ToolCards from "../components/ToolCards.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Focus & Routine Timers | Pomodoro & Intervals | Online Stopwatch"
  description="Build a repeatable routine with a Pomodoro focus timer or a custom work/rest interval timer. Choose your own session lengths and rounds."
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">WORK. REST. REPEAT.</span>
      <h1>
        Find a rhythm.
        <br />
        <span>Make it your own.</span>
      </h1>
      <p>Two ways to bring a little intention to the time ahead.</p>
    </section>
    <ToolCards filter="focus" heading="Choose your rhythm." />
    <section class="tool-help wrap">
      <h2>Different routines, the same room to breathe.</h2>
      <div class="help-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Pomodoro for deep work</h3>
          <p>
            Set focus periods in minutes, pair them with short breaks, and
            choose a longer break for extended sessions. A useful rhythm for
            studying, writing, or desk work.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Intervals for repetition</h3>
          <p>
            Set work and rest in seconds for short drills, practice, or
            movement. Choose up to 100 rounds and let the timer handle each
            transition.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Pause when you need to</h3>
          <p>
            Both timers pause and resume without losing your place. Keep the
            browser active for alerts and test the sound before starting your
            routine.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
